{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winoa Wizard is a new witch! ready to start her quest to become the greatest witch alive! Unfortunately for her, the evil witch at Pigarse's school of Uptight witches, Catrina Underwood Nathanial Trotwether, has other plans. Sending evil wizards and witches after Winoa to stop her journey to become a great witch!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/TRAVEL4STAGES!.png?t=1742562719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle a variety of enemies helmed by the evil Catrina! 4 Unique stages, each with their own soundtrack to bop too while fighting your enemies!!<strong></strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/DEFEATBOSSES.png?t=1742562719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did your favorite childhood author call for your eradication? So did mine! Politicians suck, and they suck even more here! Fight through and find variety of British, American, and more enemies to get payback on!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/extras/KILLYOURLOCAL.png?t=1742562719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do i have to say anything else?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606180?t=1742562719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/c04c57298ddc8f84baf109fa9504891b507f225b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742562719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/ffa064aa9405206ccf62bacc70dcf6e2f1636ce5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742562719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606180/ffa064aa9405206ccf62bacc70dcf6e2f1636ce5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742562719","categories":[{"descr